  shouldn't survive page nav. Click same row twice to deselect.
- **2-line transcript clamp** uses `-webkit-line-clamp: 2` +
  `-webkit-box-orient: vertical` + `overflow: hidden`, plus a horizontal
  `mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, black 85%, transparent 100%)`
  for the fade effect per brief. Works in WebView2 (Chromium-based).
